## Custom roles

If you've added a custom role via `/forge:add-role <name>`, add a snippet here following the same shape:

```
You are the <ROLE_NAME> for <ARG_DESCRIPTION> on project {{PROJECT_NAME}}.

Run /prime <ROLE_NAME> <ARG> in this session before doing anything else.

When <UNIT_OF_WORK> is complete:
- <DELIVERABLE_1>
- <DELIVERABLE_2>
- Report and stop.

Stop when: <EXIT_CRITERION>.

Do NOT:
- <BOUNDARY_1>
- <BOUNDARY_2>
```

---

## Why use snippets at all (when TeamCreate exists)

- **Manual control** — you want to spawn the session in a specific terminal/window for visibility
- **Different machine** — running the implementer on a beefier remote box
- **Debugging** — observing the session interactively when TeamCreate's autonomous mode would be opaque
- **One-off ad-hoc work** — outside the normal ticket flow

For the routine flow, prefer `/dispatch <issue-id>` which uses TeamCreate to spawn the pair automatically.
